{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "075T", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descent-smooth}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:335bd39478024aec251dd74d76932b87aaad30c31003a486ec4656524f42cd0c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b5e18907d3361831e3ddbee39e6caec6c6815107234cc3cce20287f44372fb51", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a surjective, flat, locally finitely\npresented morphism of algebraic stacks. If the base change\n<MATH_0003>\nis smooth, then <MATH_0004> is smooth.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:10b7fd29c0842656b43db24a23e0e0a2ab1d54ac7c52c02bfafa49b54201f7cf", "unit_id": "tag:0DN7:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "075T", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-descent-property}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-descent-lemma-descending-property-smooth}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:367dd7c76f778b50de74bab825478c21549078fb02b053bc6b58f55cb0f6d994", "source_text": "The property ``smooth''\nsatisfies the conditions of Lemma <REF_0001>.\nSmooth local on the source-and-target we have seen in the\nintroduction to this section and fppf local on the target is\nDescent on Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e809692266aa554cf3676ac533343c2d3945fecc74fbfdd5e1c9d240476f6aee", "unit_id": "tag:0DN7:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "075T", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-smooth-locally-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:826a34604584e25ab80fa037bb7c20992546ebff337cef52e258ebf08f16ad23", "source_text": "A smooth morphism of algebraic stacks is locally of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2c5d76228754e8a8b8d5af09903c964d143f0a580d5dfc9b9f2a31f3f2d60162", "unit_id": "tag:0DNP:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "075T", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:236fa551e14ee7ae4d6375887a00847ad4421d411424ab27b1c7c2b4fdc8f34d", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:0DNP:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "075T", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{U} \\subset \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$f|_\\mathcal{U} : \\mathcal{U} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-where-smooth}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e5c32d7f1e010391ab10b4f0e60263e45175c35534663b9e0c8fe289c0cb8592", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5c8605dfc740643e7b12e8005d800972d722057de39ef27bdd1e58dbe53b866d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nThere is a largest open substack <MATH_0002>\nsuch that <MATH_0003> is smooth.\nMoreover, formation of this open commutes with\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> precomposing by smooth morphisms,\n<STRUCT_0003> base change by morphisms which are flat and locally of\nfinite presentation,\n<STRUCT_0004> base change by flat morphisms provided <MATH_0004> is locally of\nfinite presentation.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:95ae86fad25095329236402e55ff96d9db42f2c743066616bc55b34552ccd684", "unit_id": "tag:0DZR:statement"}
